      "claim": "The driver cannot repair the shortfall by accumulating separate in-geofence intervals. There is only one such interval on this trace (run_count 1, longest run 195 seconds), and POL-NS-06 limb (i) in any event requires a traffic advisory that is present and populated with a type of KERB_RESTRICTION, ENFORCEMENT, CLOSURE or ACCIDENT. EV-ADVIS-00203-01 is MISSING — its weight is 0.0 and the absence is itself citable — so no advisory covers this pickup road in this window, limb (i) is unavailable, and the 195-second measurement stands as the effective dwell.",
      "side": "RIDER",
